102-| I1 | 16 optimizer steps per iteration; `spm × grad_accum` = 16; the split comes from a memory smoke ("grad_accum only as needed") | Start at spm 8 / accum 1 on 2 ranks; the smoke may move to 4 / 2 | 3.4, 6.1 |
103-| I2 | The same global config on any hardware: divide per-rank `n_envs` and spm by world size | 2 × 128, 4 × 64 envs | 3.4 |
104-| I3 | The LR schedule is defined over env steps; a batch change rescales warmup and decay | Any forced deviation rescales them in the YAML | 3.4, 6.1 |
