106-| I5 | Winner-distribution critic (value 2p − 1, gamma 1), value distillation on winner probabilities | Per-seat (self, opponent) softmax from the seat's own observation | 2.2 |
107-| I6 | Last-best teacher: KL(teacher ‖ student), small coefficients, the teacher shares the student's architecture and is refreshed in place, cached path bit-for-bit equal to the combined path | Per-slot categorical KL over the grammar heads | Phase 4 |
108-| I7 | Eval against last best, 70% promotion, separate current/best checkpoints, 8 replays exported | Raw-bank winners; Kaggriculture replay format | 3.3, 7.3 |
109-| I8 | Throughput defaults: compiled GAE/loss, trunk `max-autotune-no-cudagraphs`, BF16, TF32, forced FlashAttention | Verified active in Phase 6 | 3.4, 6.x |
