   303	  writes a run statement.
   304	- **Fallback:** the GPU pod `w7ia3zvxqsvs3g`, but only if the historical ZIP
   305	  is found there with hash `619ca7a8…`, no learner is running, and the
   306	  compressed output fits the measured free disk. Workers are capped so that
   307	  other processes keep CPU.
   308	
