+  and the manifest to the volume under `/workspace/kg-v3/bc-data/<commit>/`.
+  The compressed shards then go to the GPU pod with SHA-256 verified at both
+  ends, and the data pod is terminated. Claude reads the live price first and
+  writes a run statement.
+- **Fallback:** the GPU pod `w7ia3zvxqsvs3g`, but only if the historical ZIP
+  is found there with hash `619ca7a8…`, no learner is running, and the
+  compressed output fits the measured free disk. Workers are capped so that
+  other processes keep CPU.
